			"Message": "chore(Land): Sync Element submodules to fix SCM payload deserialization\n\nUpdate the `Element` git submodule from `f42c1164` to `19ae8e1a` to resolve Source Control Management (SCM) group update failures and stabilize the build pipeline across the editor ecosystem.\n\nKey changes include:\n- **Cocoon:** Correct the `update_scm_group` RPC payload to align with `Vine.proto` definitions, replacing non-standard `scmHandle` fields with `providerId` and `groupId`.\n- **Common:** Refactor `SourceControlGroupUpdateDTO` to make `ProviderHandle` optional, supporting flexible serialization strategies for positionally passed handles.\n- **Mountain:** Prevent Tauri build failures by generating a stub `extensions.manifest.json` when missing, and refine `UpdateScmGroup` logic to emit correct `scmId` events for the Sky frontend. Additionally, extend the extension descriptor cache lifetime to 24 hours to reduce redundant rescans.\n- **Sky:** Integrate Astro build integrations to bake the extension manifest at compile-time and compress the bundle with Brotli, reducing runtime overhead.\n- **Maintain:** Consolidate lint suppressions in `build.rs` to match the main crate strategy.\n\nThese updates ensure reliable SCM synchronization across the Mountain-Cocoon-Sky IPC boundary and optimize application startup performance.",
			"SHA": "7a39f0da50fd11c798b81ce9fb4be36ac318a89f"
		},
